From 2742f17b753b211a2c86caa7ff004cd0edfc1c85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CustomKIMI <customkimi@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:21:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] customkimi: show the active provider's balance and
 session cost in the footer

Show the account balance of the provider that serves the active model (ClosedRouter or 7api) next to context usage, plus the cost of the current session. Providers are BillingProvider subclasses in utils/billing (ClosedRouterBilling, SevenApiBilling), registered in providers.ts. BillingMonitor polls balances every 60 seconds and price lists every 10 minutes. Session cost adds the usage.cost that ClosedRouter reports and prices the remaining models from their provider's published per-model prices (7api /v1/models); it is hidden when any model cannot be priced. The optional CLOSEROUTER_*_USD_PER_MILLION rates still price ClosedRouter requests without a cost. Also fills a usage slot for status_line templates.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
